    "text": "Good evening, my fellow Americans. Every day our citizens improve the lives of those around them. Today, we honor Troy Morrison. Now, Troy was in, uh, geometry class when his teacher mentioned the hypotenuse of a triangle. Troy said, \"I wish I was high on pot noose.\" Well, that really cracked me up, and it cracked up the rest of America, too. So today, I'm pleased to present Troy with the Congressional Comedy Medal of Honor. Troy, on behalf of the entire country, I just want to, uh, thank you for your fantastic off-the-cuff line. You are a true comedy hero.",
